{"title": "Inscribed Githyanki Slate (Dragon)", "pageid": 55154, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Inscribed_Githyanki_Slate_(Dragon)", "categories": ["Slates", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Book_Stone_Disc_Image.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Book_Stone_Disc_Image.png/300px-Book_Stone_Disc_Image.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Book_Stone_Disc_Image.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Inscribed Githyanki Slate (Dragon) image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Book_Stone_Disc_Image.png/300px-Book_Stone_Disc_Image.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Book_Stone_Disc_Image.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>This <b>Inscribed Githyanki Slate</b> depicts one of four scenes from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Orpheus\" title=\"Orpheus\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Orpheus.png/25px-Portrait_Orpheus.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Orpheus.png/38px-Portrait_Orpheus.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Orpheus.png/50px-Portrait_Orpheus.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Orpheus'\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Orpheus.png/25px-Portrait_Orpheus.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e0/Portrait_Orpheus.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Orpheus\" title=\"Orpheus\">Orpheus'</a> rebellion against <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vlaakith\" title=\"Vlaakith\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Vlaakith_Icon.webp/18px-Vlaakith_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Vlaakith_Icon.webp/26px-Vlaakith_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Vlaakith_Icon.webp/35px-Vlaakith_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Vlaakith\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Vlaakith_Icon.webp/18px-Vlaakith_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Vlaakith_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Vlaakith\" title=\"Vlaakith\">Vlaakith</a> and his eventual imprisonment.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>This <a href=\"/wiki/Githyanki_Slates\" title=\"Githyanki Slates\">stone disc</a> is carved with circular runes and pictographs.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Slates\" title=\"Slates\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/25px-Journal_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/38px-Journal_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/50px-Journal_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Slates\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/25px-Journal_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Slates\" title=\"Slates\">Slates</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/25px-Journal_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/38px-Journal_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/50px-Journal_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Author:  Githyanki (Faction)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/25px-Journal_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Author: <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Githyanki_(Faction)\" title=\"Githyanki (Faction)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Book_Stone_Disc_Image.png/25px-Book_Stone_Disc_Image.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Book_Stone_Disc_Image.png/38px-Book_Stone_Disc_Image.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Book_Stone_Disc_Image.png/50px-Book_Stone_Disc_Image.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Githyanki (Faction)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Book_Stone_Disc_Image.png/25px-Book_Stone_Disc_Image.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Book_Stone_Disc_Image.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Githyanki_(Faction)\" title=\"Githyanki (Faction)\">Githyanki (Faction)</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 14 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  14  gp</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Due south of the 'Beconing Cave' in the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Astral_Plane\" title=\"Astral Plane\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/38px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/50px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Astral Plane\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Astral_Plane\" title=\"Astral Plane\">Astral Plane</a>, at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;1173&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;317</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[The slate's faded symbols are hard to distinguish, let alone decipher. The drawing etched underneath them, however, are plain to see. They depict a dragon soaring above two individuals: one standing tall, the other kneeling. A circle is drawn around them, a fuzzy tail trailing behind: they are riding a comet.]\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This slate's contents may depict <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Voss\" title=\"Voss\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Portrait_Voss.png/25px-Portrait_Voss.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/Portrait_Voss.png/38px-Portrait_Voss.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/Portrait_Voss.png/50px-Portrait_Voss.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Voss\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Portrait_Voss.png/25px-Portrait_Voss.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9a/Portrait_Voss.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Voss\" title=\"Voss\">Voss</a> pledging his loyalty to Orpheus, while <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Qudenos\" title=\"Qudenos\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/29/Portrait_Qudenos.png/25px-Portrait_Qudenos.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/29/Portrait_Qudenos.png/38px-Portrait_Qudenos.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/29/Portrait_Qudenos.png/50px-Portrait_Qudenos.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Qudenos\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/29/Portrait_Qudenos.png/25px-Portrait_Qudenos.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/29/Portrait_Qudenos.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Qudenos\" title=\"Qudenos\">Qudenos</a> flies overhead.</li>\n<li>This slate is only accessible when entering the Astral Plane using the <a href=\"/wiki/Planecaster\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Planecaster\">Planecaster</a>.</li>\n<li>See also:\n<ul><li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Inscribed_Githyanki_Slate_(Army)\" title=\"Inscribed Githyanki Slate (Army)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png/25px-Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png/38px-Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png/50px-Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png/25px-Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b5/Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Inscribed_Githyanki_Slate_(Army)\" title=\"Inscribed Githyanki Slate (Army)\">Inscribed Githyanki Slate (Army)</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Inscribed_Githyanki_Slate_(Devil)\" title=\"Inscribed Githyanki Slate (Devil)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png/25px-Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png/38px-Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png/50px-Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png/25px-Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b5/Book_Stone_Disc_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Inscribed_Githyanki_Slate_(Devil)\" title=\"Inscribed Githyanki Slate (Devil)\">I